# Faithful representation
%%%
tag := "Chapter2/Definition2.7.3"
number := false
%%%
**Definition 2.7.3.** A representation $`\rho : A \to \operatorname{End} V` of an algebra $`A` is **faithful** if $`\rho` is injective.

